king way too much out of this, Anis.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_52","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_53","text":"I was just kidding, hehe...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_54","text":"You all need to loosen up!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_55","text":"Sorry, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_56","text":"I'm just happy I was able to explain myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_57","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_58","text":"You shouldn't have had to defend yourself in the first place...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_counters_02_59","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_counters_02_59","text":"... I'd better not give any gifts to anyone for a while.","jump":null}],"chat":true}